# C8 anion addition: embedded DLPNO single point on the REACTANT STATE.
#
# Geometry: geometry_b973c-xtb/rs_anion/job.xyz (B97-3c minimum, no imaginary
# modes, E=-934.530754). The ANION model system (133 atoms, charge -1) built
# from the relay TS by deleting the water {130,131,132,136}; QM1 = the 17-atom
# region {55 58 61 64 120...132}.
#
# QM1 = DLPNO-CCSD(T)/def2-TZVPP (def2-TZVPP/C), closed shell, NormalPNO.
# QM2 = the 116 host atoms at GFN2-xTB with GFN-FF topology; Hirshfeld charges
# embed QM1 electrostatically. Whole system ddCOSMO(water). Single point -- no
# thermochemistry; G comes from the B97-3c geometry tier through
# orca_io.composite_free_energy_eh(geom, T, this, geom).
#
# Charge convention: QM region charge on the *xyzfile line; Charge_total = whole
# system. QM -1, host 0, total -1.
! QM/XTB DLPNO-CCSD(T) def2-TZVPP def2-TZVPP/C ddCOSMO(Water) TightSCF

%QMMM
QMATOMS
	{55 58 61 64 120 121 122 123 124 125 126 127 128 129 130 131 132}
END
Charge_total -1
Mult_total 1
AutoFF_QM2_Method GFNFF
END

%output jsonpropfile true end

%maxcore 4000

%pal
   nprocs 8
end

* xyzfile -1 1 job.xyz
